===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc}} {{term|φάντασμα||ghost|tr=phantasma|lang=grc}} + {{term|αγορευειν||to speak publicly||tr=agoreuein|lang=grc}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˌfæntæzməˈɡɒriə/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˌfæntæzməˈɡɔːriə/}}
* {{audio|en-us-phantasmagoria.ogg|Audio (US)}}
*: {{rhymes|ɔːriə}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A series of events involving rapid changes in light intensity and colour.
# A dreamlike state where real and imagined elements are blurred together.

